{"4353060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BOOMER", "steam_appid": 4353060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5119440], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Times have hit them pretty hard since they went off the air...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In BOOMER, you and up to to 5 friends must journey through The Understage, a scary place where discarded Wumpets get forgotten. How far can you get while avoiding monstrous foes, escaping the ominous fog and keeping your worst pal Boomer from blowing you all into little felt pieces! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4353060/extras/fbce07ac738917eee807c4c886bc9427.avif?t=1788200388\" width=1536 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4353060/extras/be699bb7a12bce705ed5e0774eab5834.poster.avif?t=1788200388\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4353060/extras/be699bb7a12bce705ed5e0774eab5834.webm?t=1788200388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4353060/extras/be699bb7a12bce705ed5e0774eab5834.mp4?t=1788200388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get distracted? Get blown sky high!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boomer's an anxious little fella, if you don't pass him off to a new person before his fuse reaches its bottom he'll explode, taking you with him and flying to find a new friend himself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4353060/extras/d629bbe64c328d440d2db66159242e78.avif?t=1788200388\" width=1536 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4353060/extras/56df38e8f86e1bce07eba261f60d795c.poster.avif?t=1788200388\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4353060/extras/56df38e8f86e1bce07eba261f60d795c.webm?t=1788200388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4353060/extras/56df38e8f86e1bce07eba261f60d795c.mp4?t=1788200388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balance saving money with making progress!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fog's coming so you only have so much time. Use the loot you find along your path as fuel to make it to the next station. Alternatively take a risk and bank it to increase the funds you'll have when you get there. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4353060/extras/fb26398ab318ad81723a07e7ef536be3.avif?t=1788200388\" width=1536 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4353060/extras/092cb9fb629d3a216038aa58bb56dd76.poster.avif?t=1788200388\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4353060/extras/092cb9fb629d3a216038aa58bb56dd76.webm?t=1788200388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4353060/extras/092cb9fb629d3a216038aa58bb56dd76.mp4?t=1788200388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades and items make your runs more interesting!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase items from Telemachus the shopkeep to improve your stats and increase your capabilities. The Understage is a dangerous place where it helps to be prepared. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Times have hit them pretty hard since they went off the air...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In BOOMER, you and up to to 5 friends must journey through The Understage, a scary place where discarded Wumpets get forgotten. How far can you get while avoiding monstrous foes, escaping the ominous fog and keeping your worst pal Boomer from blowing you all into little felt pieces! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4353060/extras/fbce07ac738917eee807c4c886bc9427.avif?t=1788200388\" width=1536 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4353060/extras/be699bb7a12bce705ed5e0774eab5834.poster.avif?t=1788200388\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4353060/extras/be699bb7a12bce705ed5e0774eab5834.webm?t=1788200388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4353060/extras/be699bb7a12bce705ed5e0774eab5834.mp4?t=1788200388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get distracted? Get blown sky high!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boomer's an anxious little fella, if you don't pass him off to a new person before his fuse reaches its bottom he'll explode, taking you wi